{"skill":{"slug":"hubspot-ops","displayName":"HubSpot"},"version":{"version":"1.0.5","createdAt":1780989104739,"changelog":"Add UTM attribution tags (utm_source=clawhub) to ClawLink branding links so visits from this skill page are tracked as a distinct traffic source.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":21272,"sha256":"6581bd198ddb6d948777afd9eda1bdf793ef2d7e0ab183ddccee7573233cdd61","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2378,"sha256":"88b2ac855738b8a0a4a4737564a00d65c435bef8426c3779d94714e4c5525bb8","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789544992010,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"87b7f165b7554cdfb115e4637d0bb4079508f580d480ef0d5382e83f3f9d8c90","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/87b7f165b7554cdfb115e4637d0bb4079508f580d480ef0d5382e83f3f9d8c90","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1780989428332},"skillspector":{"status":"clean","normalizedStatus":"clean","score":0,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":0,"checkedAt":1789544992010},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This HubSpot skill is a disclosed CRM integration, but users should only install it if they trust ClawLink and are comfortable granting HubSpot write access.","dimensions":[{"detail":"HubSpot access is broad but purpose-aligned for a CRM operations skill and is described as limited to the connected HubSpot user's permissions.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"Installation requires adding the ClawLink plugin to OpenClaw's tool allowlist and restarting the gateway; this is disclosed and coherent with making ClawLink tools available, though the referenced plugin is not pinned to an immutable version in the skill text.","label":"Inst